              "indent": 0,
              "version": 1,
              "children": [
                {
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "text": "Six days across the valley's most loved corners: a night on a carved cedar houseboat, Mughal gardens in full bloom, the Gulmarg Gondola up to Kongdori and quiet pine meadows around Pahalgam. Every transfer, stay and permit is handled, so you only need to look out of the window.",
